          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 48,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Someone told Jacob, and said, “Behold, your son Joseph comes to you,” and Israel strengthened himself, and sat on the bed.",
      "ko": "혹이 야곱에게 고하되 네 아들 요셉이 네게 왔다 하매 이스라엘이 힘을 내어 침상에 앉아",
      "source_text_hash": "aa73dff6f76e81da184ee8331228349f2a5ec99925d9aa643119ab38e3311e27",
      "translation_text_hash": "0428dbf1169e0396cbf3d324757727cb1bb265a3fb269d2a7c171a2628beb4e7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
